      <article  about="/departments-and-services/community-development/planning/applications-and-fees-planning-department-0" class="node">

  
<div  class="page-header">
  
  <h1  class="page-header__title h1">
          <span>Fees for the Planning Department</span>

      </h1>
  </div>

  <div  class="basic-page">
    
    

      <div class="field-content">
              
  

<div  class="rich-text">
  <div  class="flexgrid-nm">
    <div  class="rich-text__body">
              

            <div class="text-long"><p>Mesa County planning application fees have been suspended effective 2017 to present (*other fees may remain in effect).<br><br>
<br><br>
Please contact the Planning Department for more information.</p>
<p>You can view the Fee Schedule below or view / download a pdf version of the Fee Schedule below:</p>
<p>
  


  <a target="_blank" class="button button--secondary align-center" href="/sites/default/files/2022-12/planning-fee-schedule.pdf">
      

<span class="icon">
  <i class="fa-light fa-file-arrow-down" role="presentation" alt="file-arrow-down"></i>
</span>
    Application Fees Schedule (2017 &amp; 2018)
</a>
</p>
</div>
      
          </div>
  </div>
</div>
              
  

<div  class="rich-text">
  <div  class="flexgrid-nm">
    <div  class="rich-text__body">
              

